title the sweep that would have done harm
prompt Keaton said kg the unlabelled 456 -- the cheap tree-wide pass I had proposed.
think Read the comments before stamping any label, because a comment above an assert is not always about the assert, and a false reason is worse than none.
obs The first twelve read wrong. VFS may read system paths, not write them above assert(!table.allows(...)). The three rye paths in held order above assert(resp.tokens_out == 3). The dark sheet lowers to Bark paper above a colour comparison. Test-case narration, not invariant reasons.
think Sampled again spread differently rather than explaining the first sample away. It confirmed rather than softened: 361 of 377 are narration.
obs Stamping would have written 361 false invariants into caravan and pond -- the tree's most-cited rooms -- each telling a later reader that a test's description is a contract's reason.
think Measured the root rather than guessing it. All 361 sit inside a pub fn that a proof entry in the same file calls: caravan/regions.rye exports check_declared_access, check_reads, check_refusals for a witness to call, and its own run_self_test calls them too.
obs The reachability bin cannot reach them because of the pub guard I added at REDS %211 -- which exists because a selftest calling the real API is what a selftest is for. That guard is right for image/photos.rye and wrong here, and the two differ by something no in-file reading can see: crop is called from other modules, check_reads from nowhere but its own proof.
think Left the meter alone. A cross-file reachability pass is the honest discriminator and a real change to a meter corrected nine times already, several needing a second fix. It waits for its own round rather than a fast patch at the end of a long one.
obs The lesson is different from the nine before it. Those moved a number that was wrong. This one would have moved a number that was RIGHT and made the tree wrong doing it -- a count of a SHAPE is not a count of a MEANING.
obs Landed the 16 genuine ones instead: they carry // seam:, TAME's own word for the inherited-std boundary, above asserts guarding exactly that boundary. The label pattern reads seam now. Tree 97%, gap 453.
